			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Moonbrook was once a prosperous village in the south of {link:westfall}Westfall{/link}. Its people are gone. The {link:defias-brotherhood}Defias Brotherhood{/link} took the town and made it the heart of its power, and its empty houses now shelter thieves and their captains. Only one trader works openly in Moonbrook, a Defias merchant who sells to anyone with coin and asks no questions. Beneath the town lies the old gold mine that the war left behind: the {link:the-deadmines}Deadmines{/link}. The masons of {link:edwin-vancleef}Edwin VanCleef{/link} guard its entrance, for what they are building in the depths is the Brotherhood's greatest secret.]=],
