			text = [=[The Gold Coast Quarry lies on the western edge of {link:westfall}Westfall{/link}, where the plains fall toward the sea. It gave both stone and gold to the kingdom. Now {link:defias-brotherhood}Defias{/link} pillagers hold it, and the {link:riverpaw-gnolls}Riverpaw gnolls{/link} toil in its pits under the lash of their own taskmasters. The gnolls do not dig for themselves. They dig for the Brotherhood, whose allies they have become across the plains. Driving the pillagers from the quarry is one of the trials that the People's Militia sets for those who would join its ranks.]=],
