			text = [=[The Dagger Hills are the broken highlands of southern {link:westfall}Westfall{/link}, behind {link:moonbrook}Moonbrook{/link} and above the sea. Here the hardest of the Brotherhood's fighters make their camps: highwaymen who rob the roads, pathstalkers who know every trail, and brawlers who settle quarrels with their fists. The militia believes that {link:defias-brotherhood}Defias{/link} raiders who escape its patrols go to ground in these hills to plan their next attack. On the far side of the hills, near the water, a hidden way leads out of the depths of the {link:the-deadmines}Deadmines{/link}. Only those who have passed through the mines know where it lies.]=],
