			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Agent Kearnen serves {link:si-7}SI:7{/link}, the spies of {link:stormwind-city}Stormwind{/link}. For weeks she has kept watch on an abandoned watchtower south-east of {link:sentinel-hill}Sentinel Hill{/link}, which the {link:defias-brotherhood}Defias{/link} have made a base for goods smuggled along the {link:redridge-mountains}Redridge{/link} road. What she has seen troubles her. A shipment came from {link:duskwood}Duskwood{/link} with a chest, and with it came guards that are not human.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Kearnen's watch uncovers a darker trade in the Brotherhood's hands. The chest in the tower belongs to the {link:defias-brotherhood}Defias{/link} Klaven Mortwake, and its secrets lead far south to the trolls of {link:stranglethorn-vale}Stranglethorn Vale{/link}.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Deeds",
			text = [=[• She keeps a journal of all she sees at the tower.
• She waits for {link:si-7}SI:7{/link} to send another agent.]=],
		},
	},
	mentions = {
